            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "Before the new one: say the Hindi for plenty, then the Hindi for tremendous."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "index": 1,
          "type": "input",
          "title": "You'll want to know: अधिक",
          "segments": [
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "अधिक — adhik — \"more (formal), excessive\"."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "अगर पानी अधिक होगा तो चावल गीला हो जाएगा। agar pānī adhik hogā to cāval gīlā ho jāegā. If there is too much water, the rice will turn soggy."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "index": 2,
          "type": "etymology",
          "title": "The word, taken apart",
          "segments": [
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "अधिक (adhik) is a tatsama, borrowed from Sanskrit adhika, \"surpassing, more\" (Monier-Williams)."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "index": 3,
          "type": "notice",
          "title": "What you've built",
          "segments": [
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "One more word for saying what happens if."
