              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "अगर मेहमानों की तादाद बढ़ेगी तो खाना कम पड़ेगा। agar mehmānoṁ kī tādād baṛhegī to khānā kam paṛegā. If the number of guests goes up, the food will run short."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "Feminine."
            }
          ]
        },
